  "2026-10-23T06:43:05.006Z",codex-agent,"GitHub #153 reproduced in source inspection: file selection ranks by overlap, but the SDK packer retains corpus relevance ranks under token pressure. Plan: add equal-cost budget-pressure regressions with CLI controls and explain parity before changing selection ranks. Related original feature: pm-context-ax7z."
  "2026-10-23T06:45:52.501Z",codex-agent,"Regression-first reproduction: node --test --test-name-pattern='equal-cost capped' test/file-focus.test.ts fails both helper and installed-CLI assertions on the original implementation. Eight lower-overlap equal-cost identities displace focus-best-000; explicit-ID and limit-one controls pass. Fix uses the already-ranked incoming focus order for SDK token selection."
  "2026-10-23T06:52:38.981Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proof: replaced only createSdkPacker with its origin/main implementation, retaining all other fixes and tests, and rebuilt dist. node --test --test-name-pattern='equal-cost capped' test/file-focus.test.ts failed 3/3 (0 pass), exit 1: overlap helper, lifecycle/priority/id tie helper, and installed CLI lost the best focus. Restored createSdkPacker and rebuilt dist. Root discovery revert independently failed 2/2 on pm-context-gyq1."
